// CopperSpice GUI misoli — uz++ da
// Muhim: CopperSpice MINGW64 bilan qurilgan, PATH da C:/msys64/mingw64/bin bo'lishi kerak!
// Qurish va ishga tushirish:
//   $env:PATH = "C:/msys64/mingw64/bin;C:/CopperSpice/bin;$env:PATH"
//   uzpp ishga-tushirish misollar/15_oyna.uzpp --bare -I C:/CopperSpice/include -I C:/CopperSpice/include/QtCore -I C:/CopperSpice/include/QtGui -l C:/CopperSpice/lib/libCsCore2.1.dll.a -l C:/CopperSpice/lib/libCsGui2.1.dll.a

ulash <QtGui/QApplication>
ulash <QtGui/QWidget>
ulash <QtGui/QPushButton>
ulash <QtCore/QString>

butun asosiy(butun argc, belgi** argv) {
    QApplication ilova(argc, argv);
    
    QWidget oyna;
    oyna.setWindowTitle("Salom dunyo! — uz++ + CopperSpice");
    oyna.resize(400, 300);
    
    QPushButton tugma("Meni bosing!", &oyna);
    tugma.move(150, 120);
    
    oyna.show();
    
    qaytarish ilova.exec();
}
